# Testing

## Layout

- `tests/Unit/` - `Client` and `Config` behavior.
- `tests/Feature/Endpoints/` - one file per endpoint, offline.
- `tests/E2E/` - real API, read-only, skipped without `UON_API_TOKEN`.
- `tests/TestCase.php` - base case wiring a Guzzle `MockHandler`.

## Conventions

- Feature and Unit tests never hit the network. Build the endpoint with
  `$this->make(EndpointClass::class)` (mocked transport) and call it.
- Assert three things: the result is an object, the HTTP method, and the request
  path, via `$this->assertRequest('GET', '/currency.json')`.
- One behavior per test method; the mock queues one response per call, so only
  make several calls in a test when you queue extra responses.
- E2E tests must stay read-only and self-skip when the token env is absent.

## Commands

```shell
vendor/bin/phpunit --testsuite Unit,Feature
UON_API_TOKEN=xxx vendor/bin/phpunit --testsuite E2E
```
